<%- include('partials/header') %><div class="narrow-page document-page"><a class="back-link" href="/dashboard">← Your library</a><div class="doc-title"><div><div class="eyebrow">STUDY MATERIAL</div><h1><%= document.title %></h1><p><%= document.fileName %> · uploaded <%= new Date(document.createdAt).toLocaleDateString() %></p></div><span class="pdf-icon large">PDF</span></div><div class="tabs"><button class="tab active" data-tab="text">Extracted text</button><button class="tab" data-tab="notes">Smart notes</button><button class="tab" data-tab="quiz">Quiz</button><button class="tab" data-tab="cards">Flashcards</button><button class="tab" data-tab="viva">Viva mode</button></div><section class="tab-panel active" id="text"><div class="text-view"><%= document.extractedText %></div></section><section class="tab-panel" id="notes"><div class="generate-box"><span>✦</span><h2>Make this easier to remember.</h2><p>Generate concise notes with key concepts and a useful takeaway.</p><button class="button button-primary" data-generate="summary">Generate smart notes</button></div><div id="summaryResult" class="result"></div></section><section class="tab-panel" id="quiz"><div class="generate-box"><span>?</span><h2>Test your understanding.</h2><p>Five questions, instant feedback, zero pressure.</p><button class="button button-primary" data-generate="quiz">Build my quiz</button></div><div id="quizResult" class="result"></div></section><section class="tab-panel" id="cards"><div class="generate-box"><span>◇</span><h2>Make the key terms stick.</h2><p>Flip through eight quick cards made from your document.</p><button class="button button-primary" data-generate="flashcards">Create flashcards</button></div><div id="cardsResult" class="result"></div></section><section class="tab-panel" id="viva"><div class="generate-box"><span>◉</span><h2>Practice saying it out loud.</h2><p>Prepare for oral exams by explaining ideas in your own words.</p><button class="button button-primary" data-generate="viva">Start viva practice</button></div><div id="vivaResult" class="result"></div></section></div><script>window.documentId='<%= document._id %>'</script><%- include('partials/footer') %>
